Hi!
And welcome to Linux. You picked a challenging place to start, in
wanting to start with an Alpha. But .. Well, you'll learn more.

From the tone of your question(s), you have a lot to learn. Not to
worry. The people on this list are very helpful. We've all been beginers
once.
The best piece of advice I can give you right now, is get a good book on
Linux, and study.

I would highly recomend "A Practical Guide to Linux" by Sobell. No doubt
the best palce to get started (and I know that having said that, some
one will come on with their favorite book. But give this one a look.
It'll get you started.

Ric


