Are you using RJ45 to RJ45 to connect a PC and the Multia?

If so, you cannot use a straight-through cable to connect the two, you
have to use a crossover cable.

So your choice to connect two pc's RJ45 to RJ45 either requires a HUB and
two straight-through cables, or a crossover cable.  I currently don't have
the specs for the construction of that cable, but it should be avaliable
somewhere on the net.

I'm not positive from what you've told me yet that that is the problem
though.

