If you have the PC164SX mounted in a vertical case (as is probably the
case), the floppy cable has pin 1 up (towards the PS connection) and the IDE
cables have pin 1 down (towards the PCI connectors).  That is the way they
are on mine and it is working.  I did see a very small "1" near the end of
the IDE connectors.  It is very easy to miss, especially if the lighting is
dim or too bright (glare).

greg

