system. But mainly it's just looking for things like
the ld and cpp in certain locations... so if you
provide the link, it should be ok...

for example, I use egcs-1.1.12 and I had to do the
following:

change:

/usr/lib/compaq/ccc-6.2/alpha-redhat-linux/bin/ld

to point to /usr/lib/ld

create a link like:

/usr/lib/gcc-lib/alpha-redhat-linux/egcs-2.90.29

--> /usr/lib/gcc-lib/alpha-redhat-linux/egcs-2.91.66

and that's about it.

