On Mon, Sep 13, 1999 at 01:58:44PM -0400, Peter Petrakis wrote:
> Kurt Ludwig wrote:
> > 
> > My friend pete and I ran accross the same thing...
> > we didn'tresearch it a lot, but it's something in compaq's math library vs.
