Do be careful using RH5.2. DS10's didn't exist when that
version was released. I use RH6.0 on my 4 DS10's and have
NFS working without problems. I use Kernel 2.2.11 plus my 
own fixes for ncr53c8xxx and the latest tulip from Becker's
