Generally these cards aren't Alpha friendly. From what I remember they
dont implement the PCI spec correctly, perhaps for IRQ managment (I think 
they only use 4 bits for IRQ mapping - i'm probably completely off track
though, it was a while ago).

Anyway some people get them working and some don't. I haven't had success
on my UX, hard crash every time. It died when an interrupt came in to
perform the next DMA request.

