The System.map file is probably from your old 2.2.5 kernel. You could
recompile your 2.2.12 kernel, and then use the System.map file that is
generated. As for the modules, if you only got the kernel, then the modules
that it looks for won't be there. Again, if you recompile your kernel and do
"make modules" and "make modules_install", your modules will be installed,
and you won't get that message.

Praveen

