this one.)
(I will get a "new" old scsi disk to see whether this images work but at
the moment I am broke (end of the month sysmdrom). I will also get one
of those isomarked rh6.0 images to see whether it is possible to boot
from cd by srm or aboot. I will try as well whether scsi zip drives
